{
 "id": "281-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "If you have any questions or need help with anything, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Conflict is inevitable in any workplace, but it's how we handle it that matters.",
  "Effective conflict resolution is key to maintaining a positive and productive work environment.",
  "It's important to address issues directly and respectfully.",
  "When conflicts arise, ensure that you hear and understand your colleague's perspective.",
  "Empathy plays a crucial role in resolving disputes amicably.",
  "Also, remember that conflicts can often stem from misunderstandings or differences in priorities.",
  "It's important to clarify assumptions and expectations to find a common ground.",
  "Now, regarding your coding tasks, I want to emphasize the importance of using annotations for methods.",
  "Always provide clear and concise annotations to describe the purpose and functionality of your methods.",
  "This improves code readability and makes it easier for others to understand your work.",
  "By adopting this practice, you contribute to the maintainability and collaboration aspect of our codebase.",
  "If you have any questions or need further guidance, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Don't hesitate to come to me with any concerns or questions.",
  "Given the nature of your role and our current project, I think it would be best if you worked from home no more than three days a week.",
  "It's important for your development and our team dynamics that you're in the office for the rest of the week.",
  "Now, moving on to some coding standards I'd like you to follow: firstly, always add the @timer_class decorator from the pedantic module to all your classes."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
